      {
        "id": "47b72ab9-fa03-4e15-83bb-39c8faad7a3b",
        "name": "Ingress Notes",
        "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
        "typeVersion": 1,
        "position": [
          0,
          -220
        ],
        "parameters": {
          "color": 4,
          "width": 1900,
          "height": 280,
          "content": "## GitHub App webhook ingress (C4, oneshotllc/.github#31)\n\nApp hook -> Funnel :10000 -> Caddy :8460 (/webhook/* only) -> here. Get Webhook Secret reads cfg:gh_webhook_secret from loopback Redis (rotated with PATCH /app/hook/config; never stored in this workflow or its export). Verify Signature HMACs the raw body and answers 401 on mismatch, fail-closed if the secret is unset.\n\nAdmit: issues/pull_request events, open items, actions opened/reopened/edited/labeled/unlabeled/synchronize/ready_for_review. Bot actors are admitted only for opened/reopened (tickets are created by the bot from chat); bot label edits are dropped so Apply hold Label cannot re-trigger itself. Brian removing hold (unlabeled, human actor) is the fast path to the sorter's approval check.\n\nOutput is the poller's item shape, pushed to queue:intake. The 5-minute poller remains the backstop for missed deliveries; the sorter dedupes both."
        }
      }
